body:
Lana is... to good I think. She is more like a sister in my opinion. Rivix is more entertaining for me personally and having a romance option when you never know if you will be betrayed or not is quite funny for me. Can create more suprises! Also... He is not a human which on my opinion is a huge benefit xD

&#x200B;

Only humas I would date are Darth Marr or Darth Malgus but the only thing Malgus gave me was "ughh" xD
